# Mochi Todo: Privacy Policy

_Last updated: October 20, 2026_

Mochi Todo is a to-do list browser extension. This policy explains what happens to your information when you use it.

## What we collect
**Nothing.** Mochi Todo does not collect, store, transmit, sell or share any personal information or usage data.

## Where your data lives
Your lists, tasks, reminders and settings are saved only on your own device, using Chrome's built-in extension storage (`chrome.storage.local`). They are never sent to us or to any third party. The extension makes no network requests: all of its code, styles and fonts are packaged inside it.

## Permissions
- **storage**: saves your lists and settings on your device.
- **sidePanel**: lets you pin the list to Chrome's side panel.
- **alarms** and **notifications**: schedule and show the reminders you set on tasks.

## Deleting your data
Delete a task or list inside the extension, or remove the extension from Chrome (`chrome://extensions`) to erase all of its data from your device.

